        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 3910S-DD, Century Round Double Pocket Door Lock Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Century Double Pocket Door Privacy Set is made for double or French sliding doors where you would like a little privacy such as those leading to bedrooms or bathrooms. This is a complete set, sold with everything you need to secure a set of double doors. The privacy mortise lock is installed on one door and the strike plate is installed on the other door. When locked, the two pocket doors are tightly hooked together. It is good for doors 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2 inch backset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe edge pull is screwed into the door's edge so that you have something to grip in order to slide the door out of the pocket. The round flush pulls are pressure mounted into the door's face. The mortise lock body is easily mounted with two screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via an emergency turn. A privacy lock does not offer security, it offers privacy. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/century-passage-pocket-door-set-omnia-3910s-p\"><b>Century Passage Pocket Door Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/century-round-privacy-pocket-door-mortise-lock-omnia-3910s\"><b>Century Privacy Pocket Door Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 3910S-DD, Century Round Double Pocket Door Lock Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Solid Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Active Trim Diameter: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Active Trim Projection: 3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Inactive Trim Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lockbody Length: 3-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lockbody Depth: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Faceplate Length: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Faceplate Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Set:</b> <a href=\"/products/century-round-privacy-pocket-door-mortise-lock-omnia-3910s\">privacy mortise lock body</a>, two (2) flush pulls for the locking door, <a href=\"/products/century-solid-brass-round-flush-pull-omnia-7503-52\">two (2) flush pulls for the non-locking door</a>, <a href=\"/products/sliding-pocket-door-edge-pull-omnia-3917\">two (2) edge pulls</a>, strike plate, and all mounting hardware. For One Pair of Pocket Doors. (2 doors).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/made-usa-logo.jpg?v=1704354497\" width=\"515\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Century Double Pocket Door Privacy Set",
                "description": "Omnia 3910S-DD, Solid Brass Double Pocket Door Privacy Set - The Solid Brass Double Pocket Door Privacy Set is made for double or French sliding doors where you would like a little privacy such as those leading to bedrooms or bathrooms. This is a complete set, sold with everything you need to secure a set of double doors. The privacy mortise lock is installed on one door and the strike plate is installed on the other door. When locked, the two pocket doors are tightly hooked together. It is good for doors 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2 inch backset. \r\n",
                "keywords": "Double Sliding Pocket Door Locksets, Solid Brass Double Pocket Door Privacy Sets, Omnia 3910S-DD, OMN-3910S-DD, omnia 3910, omnia 3910DD, Double Pocket Door Lock Sets, Round Double Pocket Door Locks, pocket door privacy locks, pocket doors privacy locks, Double Sliding Pocket Doors, Double Pocket Doors,  Lock Double Sliding Pocket Doors, lock Double Pocket Doors, Double Sliding Pocket Door locks, Double  Pocket Door lock, Double Pocket Door privacy locks, french pocket door hardware, omnia 7503, Century Double Pocket Door Privacy Sets,"
